flowchart TB
  T[Ticket text: UNTRUSTED customer input] --> S[AiSanitizer: NFKC, strip tags, drop instruction-like sentences, redact PII and secrets, bound length]
  S --> P{{Trust boundary: AiProvider is a pure function, no DB, no tenant, no actions}}
  P --> M[Mock rule-based provider - default, executed]
  P -.-> H[HttpAiProvider stub - never called for real]
  M --> V[Output validation: category in tenant list, priority enum, article ids from candidates, confidence clamped, tags and URLs stripped]
  H -.-> V
  V --> I[Inert PENDING_REVIEW suggestion + audit]
  I --> G{Human approval gate: AGENT or above}
  G -->|approve or edit| C[One PUBLIC aiGenerated comment]
  G -->|reject| R[Nothing posted, reason recorded]
